          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In December 2022, NEET MA recorded $64k non-cash reduction to adjust the capital strucutre. In September 2023, NEET MA repaid $533K on the $4.5M Q2 2021 loan from NextEra Energy Capital Holdings, Inc.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
